{
  "id": 1033,
  "name": "leaf-letter--pikachu",
  "fling_power": 30,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "loot",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/24/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "このはで　つくった　てがみ。\nピカチュウの　あしあとで\nなにかが　かかれて　いる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "나뭇잎으로 만든 편지.\n피카츄의 발자국으로\n무언가가 쓰여 있다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用樹葉做的信。\n上面有皮卡丘的腳印。\n好像是想表達些什麼。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une lettre rédigée sur une feuille d’arbre.\nPikachu semble y avoir écrit quelque chose\navec ses pattes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Brief, der auf einem Blatt verfasst wurde.\nPikachu scheint mit seinen Pfotenabdrücken\netwas geschrieben zu haben.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una carta escrita en una hoja. Hay huellas de Pikachu\nestampadas en ella y parecen guardar algún significado.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una lettera scritta sulla foglia di un albero, dove le\nimpronte di Pikachu sembrano formare delle frasi\ndi senso compiuto.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A letter written on a leaf. Something is written using\nPikachu’s footprints.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "木の葉で　作った　手紙。\nピカチュウの　足あとで\nなにかが　書かれて　いる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以树叶制作的信件。\n上面留有皮卡丘的足迹，\n好像是要表达些什么。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "lets-go-pikachu-lets-go-eevee",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/19/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
